WEBVTT

00:01:56.066 --> 00:01:59.066
It appears we meet again at last,
Miss Zola.

00:02:00.733 --> 00:02:01.733
That's!

00:02:02.233 --> 00:02:04.303
You're a mean woman.

00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:08.533
The first two meetings,
you pulled a vanishing act on me.

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:12.773
Hopefully, this time you'll
stick around for a while.

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:23.303
Now then...
This time, we're your opponents.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:28.400
INTO LOGI'S SHIP

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:35.230
General Logi, it appears the enemy has
reached the second defense line

00:02:35.266 --> 00:02:39.266
and made contact with
Schneider, Andropov and Lemaire.

00:02:40.366 --> 00:02:43.496
What would you like to do?
Is there something you had in mind?

00:02:43.866 --> 00:02:44.526
Yes...

00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:54.366
Listen up. We've got three opponents.
One of them will probably come after me.

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:59.103
Jiro and Marumaro,
you guys take on the remaining two.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:00.670
Understood.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.400
Leave it to us, Maro!

00:03:03.033 --> 00:03:04.903
I'll take care of him first.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.930
After that, it'll be three against two.
Hang in there until then.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:10.370
What about me?!

00:03:10.733 --> 00:03:15.873
Listen. Our objective is to
recover the Extra Seven.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.200
In order to do that,
we must get Bouquet to Logi's ship.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:23.430
Shu and Kluke, you guys get to
Logi's ship while covering for Bouquet.

00:03:23.833 --> 00:03:24.833
Got it.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.270
Bouquet.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.130
Everything depends on your power.

00:03:29.533 --> 00:03:31.303
R-Right!

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:32.470
Let's go!

00:04:28.633 --> 00:04:29.303
Go!

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.170
Right!

00:04:35.166 --> 00:04:36.166
I don't think so!

00:04:45.233 --> 00:04:47.673
Maro!

00:04:57.666 --> 00:04:58.866
We won't let you go after them.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.670
We're your opponents, maro.

00:05:01.533 --> 00:05:02.633
This little brat!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.400
We must report to General Logi.

00:05:08.066 --> 00:05:13.396
Hats off to you. Truly wonderful.
I really admire you.

00:05:13.933 --> 00:05:17.903
Get on with it and let's finish this.
I don't have much time.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.900
Don't be so hasty.

00:05:20.633 --> 00:05:24.633
Things won't always go
according to your plan.

00:05:28.966 --> 00:05:29.996
This is payback.

00:05:30.833 --> 00:05:32.833
Jiro! Marumaro! Get down!

00:05:44.766 --> 00:05:46.926
Hey, what's that?!

00:05:47.166 --> 00:05:48.826
It came from the direction
where everyone is!

00:05:49.733 --> 00:05:50.803
Let's go, Shu!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.730
We have to do what
we're supposed to do!

00:06:10.733 --> 00:06:13.003
At last, it's just the two of us.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.930
I get it. So that's what this is.

00:06:19.466 --> 00:06:23.526
You had no intention of dealing with
the others from the beginning, right?

00:06:24.166 --> 00:06:26.966
Indeed, Miss Zola.
You're very perceptive.

00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:29.773
Why are you that obsessed with me?

00:06:29.966 --> 00:06:31.196
Obsessed?

00:06:31.366 --> 00:06:38.366
Obviously, your mission was to stall us here.
But what's the deal with this?

00:06:39.066 --> 00:06:41.626
My team's still inexperienced.

00:06:41.666 --> 00:06:44.026
We're at a disadvantage
in a battle as a group.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.700
But you prefer to fight me
one-on-one for the fun of it.

00:06:47.766 --> 00:06:50.496
If that's not obsession,
then what is it?

00:06:50.733 --> 00:06:55.903
Nobody has wounded my pride
as much as you have in my life!

00:06:56.666 --> 00:06:58.996
Someone possessing great intellect
as well as beauty...

00:06:59.433 --> 00:07:01.873
That is exactly what I desire to be.

00:07:02.133 --> 00:07:06.233
However, the person that stood
before you was an unsightly me...

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:16.170
Killing you is the only way for me
to defend my identity!

00:07:16.333 --> 00:07:18.773
I'll stop at nothing for that purpose!

00:07:21.333 --> 00:07:25.703
I can't believe I got so worked up...

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:27.670
That's enough talk.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:32.170
I told you before.
We don't have time.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:36.330
Fine with me.
Let's engage in a deadly fight.

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:45.800
Maro...

00:07:45.933 --> 00:07:46.603
Damn it!

00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:47.703
Where's Zola?!

00:07:50.666 --> 00:07:51.696
Whoops.

00:07:55.033 --> 00:07:56.103
Enemies, maro!

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:57.800
So it missed, huh?

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.800
It's no big deal.

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.730
Jeez. That jerk Lemaire...

00:08:03.066 --> 00:08:04.626
Let's just let him do as he likes.

00:08:11.066 --> 00:08:11.726
Here they come!

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.370
Okay, maro!

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.070
Rock Weapon!

00:08:31.066 --> 00:08:31.726
Damn it!

00:08:31.766 --> 00:08:33.326
This is really bad, maro!

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.470
Where're you looking at?

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:09.100
Do you know why I went to the trouble
of changing the terrain for our battle?!

00:09:22.666 --> 00:09:25.166
So he's using that weapon
to keep me penned in,

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:26.830
so I won't be able to attack?

00:09:27.533 --> 00:09:32.573
You must have realized, Miss Zola.
This is my terrain now.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:36.330
Escaping from a crater will prove
to be exceedingly difficult.

00:09:39.366 --> 00:09:43.396
You can't escape from my fangs!

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:57.800
You're mine now, Miss Zola!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.470
You've finally gotten down
on your knees for me.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:20.670
I wanted to see that look on your face!
There's nothing as pleasing as this!

00:10:22.866 --> 00:10:24.466
You sure go on and on...

00:10:26.566 --> 00:10:27.926
Look, Shu!

00:10:31.533 --> 00:10:32.533
So that's...

00:10:32.666 --> 00:10:33.666
Logi's ship!

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.530
You!

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.570
General Logi!

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:04.930
He's kind of scary...

00:11:05.833 --> 00:11:10.503
It's been a long time.
I heard a lot about your exploits.

00:11:11.033 --> 00:11:13.833
However, more people died
needlessly on account of that.

00:11:14.433 --> 00:11:16.573
If you had just kept quiet
and done nothing,

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.770
people around you didn't
have to die for nothing.

00:11:19.033 --> 00:11:20.373
Die for nothing, you say?!

00:11:30.266 --> 00:11:31.566
You jerk!

00:11:31.733 --> 00:11:32.833
Shu, don't do it!

00:11:33.566 --> 00:11:36.026
Have you forgotten what
we're supposed to do?!

00:11:38.966 --> 00:11:41.296
Everything will get messed up
if you get all worked up here!

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:44.300
Homeron's efforts will be wasted!

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.130
Y-Yeah, I know...

00:11:47.866 --> 00:11:49.726
Show me.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.270
Shu!

00:11:51.933 --> 00:11:54.573
Show me how much stronger
you've gotten since the last time.

00:11:56.566 --> 00:11:57.766
Don't underestimate me!

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:01.130
I'll defeat you here and move on ahead,
no matter what!

00:12:12.566 --> 00:12:15.426
Blue Dragon... It's been a while.

00:12:19.233 --> 00:12:20.803
My name is Valkyrie.

00:12:21.133 --> 00:12:25.873
I serve my master General Logi
and shall become his sword and shield!

00:12:26.133 --> 00:12:28.103
I've seen her before...

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.300
Let's go, Blue Dragon!

00:12:30.533 --> 00:12:31.533
Yeah!

00:12:33.333 --> 00:12:34.003
Here he comes!

00:12:34.766 --> 00:12:35.426
Yes, sir!

00:12:46.666 --> 00:12:49.726
Now's your chance! Go!
We'll take care of the fight here!

00:12:50.033 --> 00:12:50.703
- Okay!
- Okay!

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.230
General Logi, what shall I do?

00:13:01.466 --> 00:13:04.296
Don't be concerned.
Don't bother with those two.

00:13:04.566 --> 00:13:07.126
Let's enjoy a rematch with Blue Dragon.

00:13:08.333 --> 00:13:10.773
Don't think I'm the same as before!

00:13:13.166 --> 00:13:14.226
Hey, Shu.

00:13:14.666 --> 00:13:17.196
You've gotten stronger
than the last time,

00:13:17.233 --> 00:13:19.833
but he's much more powerful
than all the others.

00:13:20.033 --> 00:13:20.703
Right.

00:13:27.766 --> 00:13:29.366
Such overwhelming power.

00:13:58.266 --> 00:14:02.126
Indeed, by how you
use your weapons,

00:14:02.166 --> 00:14:05.596
you have the total control
of the dimension of this crater.

00:14:06.833 --> 00:14:08.973
I can't move around carelessly.

00:14:12.233 --> 00:14:15.373
However, it's not a big deal
once I'm used to your moves!

00:14:17.933 --> 00:14:22.303
So you're saying I can't
surpass you no matter what?

00:14:23.066 --> 00:14:23.726
That's right.

00:14:25.433 --> 00:14:27.233
That's my Miss Zola...

00:14:28.866 --> 00:14:30.996
Otherwise it wouldn't be much fun!

00:14:32.466 --> 00:14:35.366
Yes, the Power Booster...

00:14:35.533 --> 00:14:37.003
Thanks to our unfortunate comrades,

00:14:37.033 --> 00:14:41.033
we figured out that it's something
we should use when the time is right.

00:14:45.366 --> 00:14:46.796
You never learn.

00:14:46.966 --> 00:14:48.326
I don't know about that.

00:15:09.733 --> 00:15:13.033
I'll leave the rest to you.
I'm going after the other one.

00:15:13.066 --> 00:15:13.726
Alright.

00:15:14.566 --> 00:15:15.966
Y-You okay?

00:15:16.233 --> 00:15:17.903
M-Maro...

00:15:18.066 --> 00:15:19.426
You aren't going anywhere!

00:15:21.466 --> 00:15:23.526
This brat's sure slow on the uptake.

00:15:23.666 --> 00:15:24.326
What a pest.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:26.100
Shut up!

00:15:26.466 --> 00:15:29.966
Shu and the others will be in trouble
if we get defeated, maro!

00:15:31.366 --> 00:15:32.966
I'll end this at once.

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:37.730
W-What, maro?!

00:15:37.766 --> 00:15:39.426
It's a bluff!
Let's go!

00:15:45.866 --> 00:15:47.896
Crushing Nail!

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:59.030
Shu, was it? You're defenseless
when you attack.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:11.670
There's no denying you still don't know
how to manage Blue Dragon's power.

00:16:12.333 --> 00:16:13.373
Hey, Shu!

00:16:14.066 --> 00:16:15.996
I'd hate to get beaten by
the same guy twice.

00:16:16.033 --> 00:16:17.033
I won't have it!

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:20.300
I know, but this guy...

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:24.230
He's so powerful.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:27.870
He's just gonna nail us with
a counterattack if we attack!

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:31.500
You idiot! Don't think too much!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:32.800
Shut up!

00:16:33.166 --> 00:16:35.966
Since it's come to this, we'll gain some
momentum and bring him down!

00:16:36.466 --> 00:16:38.596
Fire Crisis!

00:16:54.533 --> 00:16:56.073
Look at you...

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:59.630
At the end of the day, is this all you are?!

00:17:02.366 --> 00:17:04.626
Fire Crisis didn't work on him...

00:17:08.366 --> 00:17:10.766
Is this as far as you go, boy?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.930
Shu! Hey, Shu!

00:17:17.366 --> 00:17:20.866
Can... Can I not defeat him?!

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:23.400
Here he comes, Shu!

00:17:37.766 --> 00:17:40.196
Kluke! Over there! That ship!

00:17:41.933 --> 00:17:42.603
Shu?!

00:17:44.033 --> 00:17:45.033
What's the matter?

00:17:45.066 --> 00:17:47.466
Huh?!
Oh, it's nothing.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:49.030
We've got to get to that ship...

00:17:49.066 --> 00:17:51.496
Hey, did something happen to Shu?

00:17:53.666 --> 00:17:57.566
Uh-uh...
I don't know. It's probably nothing...

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:02.200
Kluke, go back.

00:18:02.566 --> 00:18:07.496
Hey! What're you talking about?
I'm supposed to protect you, remember?

00:18:07.666 --> 00:18:11.526
Yeah, but this is all for nothing
if Shu fails, right?

00:18:16.166 --> 00:18:21.126
I'll be fine by myself.
I'll recover the Extra Seven somehow!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.200
Everyone's doing their best,
so I'll do the same!

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.430
That's what I'm supposed to do.

00:18:28.333 --> 00:18:30.933
But you're the only one
who can save Shu!

00:18:32.033 --> 00:18:33.533
I can't save him.

00:18:36.566 --> 00:18:40.426
Protecting those who are in trouble
is what you're supposed to do.

00:18:40.966 --> 00:18:43.026
Let's both carry out
what we're supposed to do!

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:44.700
Bouquet...

00:18:45.133 --> 00:18:48.233
Okay? Get going! Go save Shu!

00:18:51.266 --> 00:18:52.266
Got it!

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:53.500
All right!

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:59.200
Use this.
This might help even for a little bit.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.000
Thanks.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.700
Hang in there!

00:19:03.733 --> 00:19:07.933
Leave it to me!
I leave my darling to you!

00:19:08.233 --> 00:19:09.703
Oh, come on...

00:19:29.933 --> 00:19:32.673
Now, this makes it difficult
for you to move around, right?

00:19:32.933 --> 00:19:36.403
That shield of yours...
It's rather useful, isn't it?

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:39.370
That's as much confidence
as you're going to show.

00:19:49.366 --> 00:19:53.966
This space is a cage of blades now.
You won't be able to knock them down.

00:19:54.133 --> 00:19:57.673
You won't even have to move.
They will slowly cut you into little pieces.

00:19:57.966 --> 00:19:59.096
However!

00:19:59.433 --> 00:20:02.603
I'll do you a favor and kill you first!

00:20:02.933 --> 00:20:03.933
Miss Zola!

00:20:03.966 --> 00:20:05.326
This is goodbye!

00:20:22.366 --> 00:20:26.026
Miss Zola...
This is the end!

00:20:28.066 --> 00:20:28.726
What?!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.400
Hornet Assassin!

00:20:58.966 --> 00:21:00.226
Too bad.

00:21:00.566 --> 00:21:01.726
W-Why?

00:21:02.233 --> 00:21:03.833
You used too much power.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:10.170
You just didn't realize that
your power was starting to weaken.

00:21:10.466 --> 00:21:11.466
But...

00:21:12.533 --> 00:21:15.673
I can take on some hits no problem

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.800
as long as I save my energy
and focus on the defense.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:23.800
Then you were pretending like
you were being beaten?

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:29.930
All that was left was to wait for your power
to max out and then weaken.

00:21:31.066 --> 00:21:33.866
So you thought I wouldn't
notice my growing weak

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:37.570
if you continued to pretend like
you were being beaten...

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:41.800
Very impressive, Miss Zola.

00:21:53.366 --> 00:21:54.896
This is it, boy!

00:22:01.166 --> 00:22:03.196
Rose in May!

00:22:14.466 --> 00:22:16.396
Jeez, you're so pathetic!

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:18.630
Kluke! Why?!

00:22:19.066 --> 00:22:21.066
Why, my foot!

00:22:21.666 --> 00:22:24.166
I came back because I was
concerned about leaving you alone.

00:22:24.800 --> 00:22:27.270
You were probably just sitting around
crying anyway, right?!

00:22:27.933 --> 00:22:29.473
H-Hell no!

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:30.500
It's okay.

00:22:31.300 --> 00:22:35.330
I'll back you up,
so you fight with everything you got!

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:36.270
Right!

00:22:41.033 --> 00:22:42.433
This is interesting!

00:24:17.866 --> 00:24:20.826
With Kluke's support,
Shu fights back against Logi.

00:24:20.966 --> 00:24:23.566
A super dimensional battle is waged.

00:24:23.633 --> 00:24:25.633
Come to think of it,
what's going on with your hair, Shu?

00:24:25.666 --> 00:24:28.126
Hey, cut it out.
Don't remove this hair band!

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:29.770
I won't take any responsibility
for what happens.

00:24:29.800 --> 00:24:33.830
Oh, it's come off? Huh?
This stinks! Don't you wash your hair?

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:36.570
Next on Blue Dragon:
Sneaky Sneaky Shock!
